  "verses": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:1",
      "text": "So, as someone locked up for the Lord, I'm urging you: live in a way that matches the call you received."
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:2",
      "text": "Stay humble and gentle; be patient, and make room for each other in love."
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:3",
      "text": "Do the work to protect the Spirit's unity, tied together by peace. 🤝"
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:4",
      "text": "One body, one Spirit—just as you were called to one hope."
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:5",
      "text": "One Lord, one faith, one baptism;"
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:6",
      "text": "one God and Father of all, over all, working through all, and present in all."
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:7",
      "text": "Still, Christ gave each of us grace in the measure he chose."
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:8",
      "text": "That's why Scripture says: ‘When he went up high, he led a crowd of captives and gave gifts to people.’"
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:9",
      "text": "Now, what does ‘he went up’ mean if he hadn't first come down to the earth below?"
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:10",
      "text": "The one who came down is also the one who went far above all the heavens, to fill everything."
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:11",
      "text": "He gave some as apostles, some as prophets, some as evangelists, and some as shepherds and teachers—"
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:12",
      "text": "to equip God's people for service and build up Christ's body,"
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:13",
      "text": "until all o…321 tokens truncated…e numb and handed themselves over to shameless desire, chasing every kind of impurity and more."
    },
    {
      "number": 20,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:20",
      "text": "But that isn't how you learned Christ—"
    },
    {
      "number": 21,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:21",
      "text": "if you really heard him and were taught in him, with the truth found in Jesus:"
    },
    {
      "number": 22,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:22",
      "text": "take off your old self, the way you used to live, rotting away under desires that trick you;"
    },
    {
      "number": 23,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:23",
      "text": "let God renew the way your mind thinks;"
    },
    {
      "number": 24,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:24",
      "text": "and put on the new self, created to look like God in true righteousness and holiness."
    },
    {
      "number": 25,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:25",
      "text": "So drop the lies. Tell the truth to your neighbor, because we're all connected to each other."
    },
    {
      "number": 26,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:26",
      "text": "‘Be angry, but don't sin.’ Don't let the sun go down while you're still angry,"
    },
    {
      "number": 27,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:27",
      "text": "and don't give the devil a foothold."
    },
    {
      "number": 28,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:28",
      "text": "If you used to steal, stop. Work honestly with your hands at something good, so you can share with someone who needs help."
    },
    {
      "number": 29,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:29",
      "text": "Don't let rotten talk leave your mouth. Say what helps build people up when they need it, so your words can give grace to those listening."
    },
    {
      "number": 30,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:30",
      "text": "Don't grieve God's Holy Spirit, who marked you for the day God sets you free. 🔒"
    },
    {
      "number": 31,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:31",
      "text": "Get rid of bitterness, rage, anger, shouting, slander, and every kind of malice."
    },
    {
      "number": 32,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:4:32",
      "text": "Be kind to each other, tenderhearted, forgiving each other just as God forgave you in Christ. 💛"
    }
  ]
